OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of bridge 'at risk of
OL,4,Acollapse' complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original Darley Abbey Mills Bridge
OL,7,Fwhich was deemed to be at "high risk of
OL,8,Fcollapse" has been demolished.
OL,10,FThe bridge closed in May 2022 due to
OL,11,Fsafety concerns and a temporary bridge,
OL,12,Fknown as Walter's Walkway, was
OL,13,Finstalled.
OL,15,FWalter's Walkway - which was closed in
OL,16,FDecember - was removed in early July
OL,17,Fbefore the demolition of the original
OL,18,Fstructure began.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
