OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of bridge 'at risk of
OL,4,Acollapse' complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council said on Tuesday the
OL,7,Fbridge had been removed and work was
OL,8,Fongoing at the site as it prepared for
OL,9,Fthe reinstatement of Walter's Walkway
OL,10,F"as soon as possible".
